conch.app carries uv (https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) at Contents/Helpers/uv.

uv is Copyright (c) 2025 Astral Software Inc., and is dual-licensed under the
MIT license (LICENSE-MIT) or the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE),
at your option. Both texts are included beside this notice, unmodified, from
the uv source tree at the pinned release tag.

conch runs it for one job: building conch's own Python environment for its
natural voices under ~/.cache/conch/voice (src/voice-env.ts). The pinned
version and the sha256 of its release tarball are in scripts/fetch-uv.sh;
scripts/embed-uv.sh copies it into the app and signs it with the app's identity.
